URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/copy-of-public-tour-a-closer-look
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53737452733551.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/copy
 -of-public-tour-a-closer-look\n\nDiscover new details\, perspectives\, and
  connections with Cantor’s “A Closer Look” tours. Led by a Stanford 
 Student Guide or volunteer Museum Engagement Guide\, each tour focuses on 
 three to four artworks organized around a theme\, providing participants w
 ith opportunities for contemplation and conversation.\n\nFirst come\, firs
 t served. Tours do not require a reservation and are free of charge. The t
 our will last between 45 minutes and an hour\, depending on the flow of co
 nversation! Please check in at the visitor services desk* in the main muse
 um lobby.\n\n*If you plan to bring a large group with you (10 people or mo
 re)\, please notify us one week in advance via this form so we can inform 
 our Guides. Thank you!
END:VEVENT
