 Continuing Medical Education (ACCME)\, the Accreditation Council for Pharm
 acy Education (ACPE)\, and the American Nurses Credentialing Center (ANCC)
 \, to provide continuing education for the healthcare team. \n\nCredit Des
 ignation \nAmerican Medical Association (AMA) \nStanford Medicine designat
 es this Live Activity for a maximum of 17 AMA PRA Category 1 CreditsT
