SUMMARY:[現場] 2026 Fall MFA Documentary Film Screening
LOCATION:McMurtry Building\, Oshman Hall
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2026-fall-mfa-documentary-film-screen
 ing
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53949146025249.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/2026
 -fall-mfa-documentary-film-screening\n\nThe Department of Art & Art Histor
 y presents a fall screening of six short films by first-year graduate stud
 ents in the Documentary Film & Video MFA program. Q&A with filmmakers and 
 a small reception to immediately follow the screening. \n\nVISITOR INFORMA
 TION: Oshman Hall is located in the McMurtry Building on Stanford campus a
 t 355 Roth Way. Visitor parking is free after 4pm on weekdays\, except by 
 the Oval. Alternatively\, take the Caltrain to Palo Alto Transit Center an
 d ride the free Stanford Marguerite Shuttle. If you need a disability-rela
 ted accommodation or wheelchair access information\, please contact Julian
 ne White at jgwhite@stanford.edu. This event is open to Stanford affiliate
 s and the general public. Admission is free. Seating is limited to 125 att
 endees and will be allocated on a first-come\, first-served basis.
END:VEVENT
