 ticipation Credit (8.00 hours)\n\nTarget AudienceSpecialties - HematologyP
 rofessions - Fellow/Resident\, Non-Physician\, Physician ObjectivesAt the 
 conclusion of this activity\, learners should be able to:\n1. Implement th
 e use of new chemotherapeutics and biologics in subpopulations of acute my
 e
