SUMMARY:[現場] Ecumenical Christmas Eve Family Service
LOCATION:Memorial Church
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/ecumenical-christmas-eve-family-servi
 ce
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54567995742374.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/ecum
 enical-christmas-eve-family-service\n\nJoin us at Stanford Memorial Church
  for a festive\, family-friendly Christmas Eve service for all ages!\n\nTh
 e service will feature the Crystal Children’s Choir\, under the directio
 n of Karl Chang.\n\nAttendees are encouraged to bring new\, unwrapped toys
  and books to be donated to local children in need.\n\nAdmission is free\,
  and seating is available on a first-come\, first-served basis. Doors open
  at 3:15 p.m.\, and the service begins at 4:00 p.m.
